## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Codex
## Notes: A dynamic, character-aware progression companion for WoW Classic Forever. Recommends what to do next from your class, race, faction, level and location; you stay in control (choose your route zone and style, skip, add, toggle systems). Read-only: never accepts, completes or turns in quests. Data is partial and ATT-derived data is shown as UNVERIFIED. Local development build.
## Author: WoW Forever open database project
## Version: 0.4.4
## OptionalDeps: QuestieDB
## SavedVariables: ForeverCodexDB

